      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Campti%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first written record of Campti appears in 1745 when French missionary Père Valentin visited the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Campti%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Union Brigadier‑General Smith burned what remained of Campti during the war on April 14, 1864.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
